            "notes": "\ud83d\udcab For Round 1, you wanna take [Stinger](item_e9d0d530-d620-4e74-a34d-38cdebfeb9a4) as it provides you with plenty extra poke and possibilities to secure kills very easily.\n\nIn the first round, you want to stick to your team and heal as much as possible to farm cash, but always remember to go for free poke with [Stinger](item_e9d0d530-d620-4e74-a34d-38cdebfeb9a4) because it is really strong! \n\nIdeally, you wanna go for the 3 offensive items to get the max heals and dmg output, but you can also go for defensive options instead of the WP%. \ud83d\udcab",
