            "notes": "\ud83d\udcab For Round 2, you can make a decision based on the enemy team:\n\nIs there a Pharah? Are your DPS struggling already based on the first Round? Maybe you lack hitscan because they just made silly picks? \n\u2714\ufe0f Rush [Aerial Distresser](item_0fcb9020-c729-49b9-b398-3223797b6204) even if you need to sell other items\n\u2716\ufe0f Follow the build as is [Vantage Shot](item_6d7a0598-07cf-45ea-bbf5-c7e7b975e07a) and [Wrist Wraps](item_19183386-c859-42ca-93f2-355d47d01e36) are some very valid options.\n\nWe get more Damage while be are in the air which we will try to abuse a lot, except a Soldier:76 or Ashe are trying to pick us out of the air. \nAnd Wrist Wrap also adds to our Damage with Stinger.\n\n\u2757\ufe0fFrom here, you can already secure kills on your own, but don't overextend and don't go too crazy with it, your team still needs your heals - so please still stay close! \ud83d\udcab",
