        {
            "id": "2f20e3db-ebee-4009-9d1d-40fb1fd0fd5c",
            "build_id": "f627e3b7-772d-440c-a67f-aca9cecc3353",
            "round_number": 3,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-05T12:23:25.001084+00:00",
            "notes": "\ud83d\udcab Round 3 Power will be [Pulsar Plus](item_4795ae1f-580d-47ec-a01d-0933cba56212) \n\nThe reason for this is: We want to buy [Three-tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429) and being able to use our Torpedoes more to maximize our efficiency with it is just a very decent choice!\n\nAnother option would be to go for the [Hyper Healer](item_108336b3-54d2-4d69-8ea4-c2da5affb7ca) Power and take [Pulsar Plus](item_4795ae1f-580d-47ec-a01d-0933cba56212) in Round 5 if it makes you feel a bit more safe.\n\nFrom my experience, it can definitely help if you struggle a bit, but it's pushing your Powerspike a bit farther back!\n\nIf you already had to get [Aerial Distresser](item_0fcb9020-c729-49b9-b398-3223797b6204) and you are struggling to take down Pharah still because she keeps getting healed you should look into buying [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505).\nThis is very situational, but it can help a lot!\nBut [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) is also a great addition to your build at a later state to help you take down Supports or DPS by yourself!\n\nThe reason why [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) is a great option for your Build in general is: [Stinger](item_e9d0d530-d620-4e74-a34d-38cdebfeb9a4) procs it with every instance of your Weapon Damage!\nIf that is not efficient, I don't know what is!\n\nAnd if we love something in this build it is \u2728 *Efficiency* \u2728\n\nThe playstyle from this Round on should look like this:\n- Remember to still pay attention to your own team and don't wander off too far for most of the time\n- To get the full use out of [Three-tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429) you wanna use an ability and before using another try to get 3 bursts of your weapon off on an enemy! \n\n\n\nYou will notice how just this just boosted your damage by far - but we will be hitting the real spike in Round 4! \ud83d\udcab",
