            "created_at": "2025-09-05T12:23:25.001084+00:00",
            "notes": "\ud83d\udcab If everything went well, we should now be able to have [Three-tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429) and [Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb) together.\n\nI really love this Item Combo because now we not only boosted our Damage but also our Heals since [Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb) can provide us with decent Healing bursts.\nIf you feel like you are struggling to keep someone alive with your bare healing, you can use your abilities in between your weapon bursts to maximize healing output. \n\nAt this point, you are actually spiking pretty well and should be able to take out squishy enemies by yourself, as well as provide a lot of poke on their tank to help your team take it down much easier.\nYou also provide plenty of heals with the combination of your Torpedoes and Weapon Bursts!\n\n\ud83c\udf1fThis is your time to shine! \ud83c\udf1f\ud83d\udcab",
