            "created_at": "2025-09-05T12:23:25.001084+00:00",
            "notes": "\ud83d\udcab In Round 5, we are going to take [Hyper Healer](item_108336b3-54d2-4d69-8ea4-c2da5affb7ca) - but optionally, we could also take [Medicinal Missiles](item_30eeab6c-4a1e-4a16-b9dd-e83d633caa40), just to provide even more Healing to our team if needed.\n\nAt this point, you just wanna stack more Weapon Power and/or Ability Power.\nI really like the option of [Long Range Blaster](item_9dfc20e8-9a7b-4576-bdca-d75ada1b369b) because Juno's Falloff just makes her heal and deal less damage when she is a bit further away. But with this, we can just negate the falloff a bit and still be viable when not very close!\n\nAnother option here could be [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b), as it provides you with more Ability Power when using your Weapon.\nThe Pros are:\n- [Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb) provides a stronger Burst\n- Torpedoes are stronger (Heals and Damage)\n- [Stinger](item_e9d0d530-d620-4e74-a34d-38cdebfeb9a4) also deals more Damage\n\nIn general, we always profit off of extra Ability Power (and Attack Speed) in this Build even if we mainly use our Weapon! \ud83d\udcab",
